{
  "slug": "designs-drift",
  "name": "Designs Drift",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "design-drift prevents AI agents from drifting away from your design system in real time. Lock any of existing brands design systems and every Write/Edit to a UI file is automatically scanned. Colors, fonts, spacing, and border-radius checked against the brand's actual tokens. Violations surface inline with exact fix hints. No hardcoded data: tokens are extracted dynamically from bundled SKILL.md constraint files and DESIGN.md visual token files, both of which are open-source repositories.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `check` (Audit existing UI files against the locked design system), `diff` (Token-by-token diff of a file against the locked design system), `fetch` (Preview a DESIGN.md for any brand), `lock` (Lock a brand design system for the session)\n- **Agents** (1): `drift-guard` (Autonomous design enforcement agent)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install designs-drift@claude-community` from `ihlamury/design-drift`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Yagiz Ihlamur",
    "url": "https://github.com/ihlamury"
  },
